{"title":"Career Roadmap: Career Counsellor","role":"Career Counsellor","summary":"A Career Counsellor helps students and professionals understand their interests, abilities, personality, strengths, educational options and career opportunities, and then supports them in making informed career decisions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Path"},{"type":"table","header":["Level","Category","Degree","Specialization","Target Career","Career Cluster","Typical Duration","Primary Goal"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)"},{"text":"Psychology"},{"text":"Career Counsellor"},{"text":"Psychology, Education & Career Development"},{"text":"3–4 years"},{"text":"Build foundations in psychology, assessment, counselling, career development and communication"}],[{"text":"PG"},{"text":"Psychology / Education"},{"text":"M.A./M.Sc."},{"text":"Counselling Psychology / Psychology / Career Counselling / Educational Psychology"},{"text":"Career Counsellor / Career Guidance Specialist"},{"text":"Counselling & Career Development"},{"text":"1–2 years"},{"text":"Develop advanced counselling, assessment and career-guidance capabilities"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Psychology / Research"},{"text":"Ph.D."},{"text":"Psychology / Counselling / Educational Psychology"},{"text":"Researcher / Psychologist / Academic"},{"text":"Psychology & Research"},{"text":"3–6+ years"},{"text":"Specialize in research, higher education or advanced professional practice"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"A B.Sc. Psychology provides a strong foundation for career counselling, but specific counselling, psychological assessment, or regulated psychologist roles can have additional qualification, supervised-practice, registration, or institutional requirements. A career counsellor should not represent themselves as a clinical psychologist or provide clinical treatment without the applicable qualifications."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Career Counsellor helps students and professionals understand their interests, abilities, personality, strengths, educational options and career opportunities, and then supports them in making informed career decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"The core pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Psychology","Psychology Foundations","Career Development","Psychometric Assessment","Counselling Skills","Career Research","Internship","Career Counsellor","Specialization"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof / Portfolio","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Psychology fundamentals"},{"text":"General, developmental and social psychology"},{"text":"Psychology notes + case observations"},{"text":"Weak psychology foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Assessment & counselling"},{"text":"Psychological testing, communication, counselling basics"},{"text":"Assessment projects"},{"text":"Treating tests as simple career predictors"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Career guidance"},{"text":"Career theories, education pathways, labour-market research"},{"text":"Career roadmap portfolio"},{"text":"Giving generic career advice"}],[{"text":"Year 4*"},{"text":"Professional practice"},{"text":"Advanced counselling, research, specialization"},{"text":"Internship + capstone"},{"text":"No supervised practical exposure"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"*Where the B.Sc follows a 4-year structure."}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to psychology"},{"text":"Biological bases of behaviour"},{"text":"Cognitive psychology"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Academic communication"},{"text":"Observation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Developmental psychology"},{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Personality psychology"},{"text":"Learning and motivation"},{"text":"Research fundamentals"},{"text":"Excel/statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Psychological assessment"},{"text":"Psychometrics"},{"text":"Personality assessment"},{"text":"Intelligence and aptitude concepts"},{"text":"Individual differences"},{"text":"Counselling fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Career development"},{"text":"Counselling theories"},{"text":"Communication techniques"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Basic data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a specialization:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Career counselling"},{"text":"Educational counselling"},{"text":"Counselling psychology"},{"text":"Student development"},{"text":"Psychometric assessment"},{"text":"Higher-education guidance"},{"text":"Corporate career coaching"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Career counselling internship"},{"text":"Psychometric assessment practice"},{"text":"Student counselling observations"},{"text":"Career research"},{"text":"Career-roadmap development"},{"text":"Research project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 7–8, if applicable"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced counselling"},{"text":"Career development theories"},{"text":"Labour-market analysis"},{"text":"Advanced psychometrics"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Dissertation/capstone"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Psychology Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A career counsellor needs more than knowledge of courses and jobs."},{"type":"p","text":"Build understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cognitive Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Learning"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Cognitive biases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Personality Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personality traits"},{"text":"Individual differences"},{"text":"Personality theories"},{"text":"Behavioural patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Developmental Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adolescence"},{"text":"Emerging adulthood"},{"text":"Identity development"},{"text":"Academic development"},{"text":"Career development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social influence"},{"text":"Group behaviour"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Self-concept"},{"text":"Social identity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Motivation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Achievement"},{"text":"Intrinsic/extrinsic motivation"},{"text":"Goal-setting"},{"text":"Self-efficacy"},{"text":"Persistence"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Development Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn major career-development concepts and frameworks."},{"type":"h","text":"Important Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Career interests"},{"text":"Career values"},{"text":"Aptitude"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Skills"},{"text":"Strengths"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Employability"},{"text":"Career decision-making"},{"text":"Career exploration"},{"text":"Career transitions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Development Frameworks"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Holland's RIASEC model"},{"text":"Super's Life-Span, Life-Space theory"},{"text":"Social Cognitive Career Theory"},{"text":"Career Construction Theory"},{"text":"Person–Environment Fit"},{"text":"Planned Happenstance concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not to force a student into a single career based on one test."}]},{"heading":"Psychometric Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important technical areas for a modern career counsellor."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Validity"},{"text":"Norms"},{"text":"Standardization"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Test interpretation"},{"text":"Measurement error"},{"text":"Bias"},{"text":"Ethical test administration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand different assessment domains:"},{"type":"table","header":["Assessment","Measures"],"rows":[[{"text":"Interest"},{"text":"Career/activity preferences"}],[{"text":"Aptitude"},{"text":"Potential for specific types of learning/performance"}],[{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Behavioural tendencies and traits"}],[{"text":"Values"},{"text":"What a person considers important"}],[{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Drivers of effort and engagement"}],[{"text":"Skills"},{"text":"Existing capabilities"}],[{"text":"Emotional competencies"},{"text":"Self-management and interpersonal capabilities"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Psychometric results should support counselling rather than determine a student's career automatically."}]},{"heading":"Career Counselling Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical counselling skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Open-ended questioning"},{"text":"Rapport building"},{"text":"Clarification"},{"text":"Reflective listening"},{"text":"Goal setting"},{"text":"Decision-support"},{"text":"Motivational interviewing concepts"},{"text":"Summarization"},{"text":"Action planning"},{"text":"Follow-up"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Counselling Session Structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Background","Concern Identification","Interests / Strengths / Values","Assessment, where appropriate","Interpretation","Career Exploration","Education & Skill Pathways","Options Comparison","Action Plan","Follow-up"]}]},{"heading":"Career Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A good counsellor must continuously research career pathways."},{"type":"p","text":"For every career, understand:"},{"type":"l