cal or clinical conclusions."}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Career Guidance Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Profile","Psychometric Inputs","Academic Profile","Skills","Career Database","Career Clusters","Education Roadmap","Skill Roadmap"]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible technologies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"LLM/RAG"},{"text":"Career database"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Features"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Career comparison"},{"text":"College pathway mapping"},{"text":"Skill-gap analysis"},{"text":"Career alternatives"},{"text":"UG-to-career mapping"},{"text":"Career transition suggestions"},{"text":"Labour-market information"},{"text":"Personalized learning roadmap"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should function as a decision-support system, with counsellor oversight and transparent reasoning."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Choices","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Important Skills","Potential Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"School Career Counselling"},{"text":"Student development, education pathways"},{"text":"School Career Counsellor"}],[{"text":"College Counselling"},{"text":"UG/PG pathways, admissions"},{"text":"College Counsellor"}],[{"text":"Psychometric Counselling"},{"text":"Assessment & interpretation"},{"text":"Psychometric Career Counsellor"}],[{"text":"Educational Counselling"},{"text":"Learning & student development"},{"text":"Educational Counsellor"}],[{"text":"Career Coaching"},{"text":"Goal-setting, employability"},{"text":"Career Coach"}],[{"text":"Corporate Career Development"},{"text":"Career planning, skills"},{"text":"Career Development Specialist"}],[{"text":"Higher Education Guidance"},{"text":"Universities, admissions"},{"text":"Higher Education Counsellor"}],[{"text":